{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"41000118536","bookName":"La mujer predestinada del emperador ","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x1/41x0/410x0/41000118536/41000118536.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":1982033,"followCount":32254,"introduction":"Daniel Pineda, emperador de Corria, posee una constitución única que le impide acercarse a las mujeres. Durante una visita, Ema Vega —con la esperanza de concebir un hijo suyo y convertirse en emperatriz— lo droga, involucrando sin querer a Nina Granados en su plan. Nina termina pasando la noche con Daniel, pero él desestima lo ocurrido como un simple sueño... hasta que, seis años después, conoce a un niño con la inconfundible marca de nacimiento de la realeza. ","chapterCount":75,"labels":["Hidden Identity","Secret Baby"],"tags":["Hidden Identity","Secret Baby"],"typeTwoIds":[294],"typeTwoNames":["Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Romántica","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"La-mujer-predestinada-del-emperador","bookNameLower":"la-mujer-predestinada-del-emperador","shelfTime":"2025-07-23 13:00:00","firstShelfTime":"2025-07-23 13:00:00","performerList":[{"performerId":"20496","performerName":"Moxi Liao","performerFormatName":"Moxi-Liao","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/6x9/20496/20496.jpg?time=1785987280718","videoCount":2},{"performerId":"23490","performerName":"Yuchen Zhang","performerFormatName":"Yuchen-Zhang","performerAvatar":"https://hwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/0x9/23490/23490.jpg?time=1789011315594","videoCount":6}],"performerIdList":[20496,23490]},"chapterList":[{"id":"596748150","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/05/6x3/63x5/635x8/63581100014/596748150_1/596748150.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=BjwMATyNWhpJmnAdjbb3Rz74JyOD6aKcqfF79b9BgkpTWHZ62DSTdj~zJlmZdiRcIUlkqczlYvF16lYPU9v07P45vZLAp-FzIV0YIzoAPowPiCtwYz5oRUlHSO9hRrNB6s~